Short Love Story 🌹

She used to wait at the same bus stop every evening.
He passed by every day, pretending not to notice her.

One rainy day, the bus was late.
They shared silence… then a smile… then a conversation.

Days turned into talks, talks into care.
Love grew quietly—without promises, without noise.

One day she didn’t come.
The next day, he waited… and waited.

Weeks later, a letter arrived:
“Some loves aren’t meant to stay… they’re meant to be felt.”

He smiled—because even a short love can last forever. 💕
